#: ../../administration/settings/clients.rst:4
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../administration/settings/clients.rst:6
msgid ""
"|morpheus| includes pre-configured OAuth clients and allows the user to "
"create as many additional clients as they'd like. The pre-configured clients"
" are editable but cannot be deleted. Once configured, access tokens may be "
"generated or re-generated from the :ref:`API Access section <api-access>`. "
"Their expiration times may be viewed as well. Client settings are available "
"only in the Primary Tenant and affect all Tenants."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| incluye pre-configurado OAuth clients y permite el usuario a "
"crear as muchos adicional clients as ellos'd like. El pre-configurado "
"clients son editable pero no puede ser deleted. Once configurado, acceso "
"tokens puede be generated o re-generated desde el :ref:`API Acceso sección "
"<api-acceso>`. Su expiration times puede be viewed as well. Client "
"configuración están disponibles solo en el Primary Inquilino y affect todos "
"Inquilinos."

#: ../../administration/settings/clients.rst:9
msgid "Creating an OAuth Client"
msgstr "Creando un OAuth Client"

#: ../../administration/settings/clients.rst:11
msgid ""
"To create a new OAuth Client, click :guilabel:`+ ADD` and configure the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"Un crear a nuevo OAuth Client, click :guilabel:`+ ADD` y configure lo "
"siguiente:"

#: ../../administration/settings/clients.rst:13
msgid "**CLIENT ID:** A reference name for the client in |morpheus|"
msgstr "**CLIENT ID:** Un reference nombre para el client en |morpheus|"

#: ../../administration/settings/clients.rst:14
msgid "**SECRET:** An optional OAuth client secret"
msgstr "**SECRET:** Un optional OAuth client secret"

#: ../../administration/settings/clients.rst:15
msgid ""
"**ACCESS TOKEN VALIDITY INTERVAL (SECONDS):** The length of time (in "
"seconds) during which the token should be enabled"
msgstr ""
"**ACCESS TOKEN VALIDITY INTERVAL (SECONDS):** El length de time (en seconds)"
" durante que el token debería ser habilitado"

#: ../../administration/settings/clients.rst:16
msgid ""
"**REFRESH TOKEN VALIDITY INTERVAL (SECONDS):** The length of time (in "
"seconds) during which the refresh token should be enabled"
msgstr ""
"**REFRESH TOKEN VALIDITY INTERVAL (SECONDS):** El length de time (en "
"seconds) durante que el refresh token debería ser habilitado"

#: ../../administration/settings/clients.rst:18
msgid "Once the client is configured, click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`."
msgstr "Una vez que el client es configurado, click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`."

#: ../../administration/settings/clients.rst:21
msgid "Editing and Deleting OAuth Clients"
msgstr "Editing y Deleting OAuth Clients"

#: ../../administration/settings/clients.rst:23
msgid ""
"From the OAuth client list view (|AdmSetCli|), click the pencil (|pencil|) "
"or trash can (|trash|) icons to edit or delete the OAuth Client."
msgstr ""
"Desde el OAuth client lista view (|AdmSetCli|), haga clic en el pencil "
"(|pencil|) o trash puede (|trash|) icons a editar o delete el OAuth Client."

#: ../../administration/settings/clients.rst:25
msgid ""
"Pre-configured |morpheus|-default clients may be edited but not deleted. "
"User-created clients may be edited or deleted."
msgstr ""
"Pre-configurado |morpheus|-predeterminado clients puede be edited pero no "
"deleted. Usuario-creado clients puede be edited o deleted."
